.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: ISC
.Dd June 9, 2026
.Dt MBT_STORAGE 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mbt_torrent_open_storage_file ,
.Nm mbt_torrent_open_storage_memory
.Nd torrent storage backends
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In mbt/storage.h
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_torrent_open_storage_file "struct mbt_torrent *t" "const struct mbt_storage_config *cfg"
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_torrent_open_storage_memory "struct mbt_torrent *t" "const struct mbt_sdbuf *buf" "const struct mbt_bitmap *bm"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Storage backends manage torrent piece data on disk or in memory.

.Pp
.Fn mbt_torrent_open_storage_file
lays out pieces according to the file list.
.Fn mbt_torrent_open_storage_memory
is suitable for testing or when an entire torrent fits in RAM;
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Functions returning
.Ft int
Return 0 on success or a negative errno value on failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mbt_torrent 3
